      638     run proc-alt-shift-f2.
      639   end.
      640   on alt-shift-f3 anywhere do:
      641     run proc-alt-shift-f3 in this-procedure .
      642   end.
      643   on alt-shift-f4 anywhere do:
      644     run proc-alt-shift-f4 in this-procedure.
      645   end.
      646   on alt-f1 anywhere do:
      647     run proc-alt-f1 in this-procedure .
      648   end.
