      782         run rep/vs-cust1.w (
      783                        input parparentproc
      784                       ,input p-curr-obj-type
      785                       ,input p-curr-obj-code
      786                       ,input from-date
      787                       ,input to-date).
      788     APPLY "ENTRY" TO BROWSE br-parts.
      789   END.
      790   ON CHOOSE OF b-print IN FRAME vs-parts
      791   DO:
      792       run gbl/pop-up.p (self:handle, no) NO-ERROR.
      793   END.
      794   ON MOUSE-SELECT-DBLCLICK OF br-parts IN FRAME vs-parts
      795   DO:
      796     APPLY "CHOOSE" TO b-docs IN FRAME vs-parts.
      797   END.
      798   ON RETURN OF br-parts IN FRAME vs-parts
      799   DO:
      800     APPLY "CHOOSE" TO b-docs IN FRAME vs-parts.
      801   END.
      802   ON CHOOSE OF MENU-ITEM m-cycle-base
      803   DO:
